<title>CANADA: Ivaco to pay arrears sooner than expected.</title>
<headline>Ivaco to pay arrears sooner than expected.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivaco Inc said on Wednesday its board declared a cash dividend on its series one to four second preferred shares of C$3.675 million to satisfy the second instalment of the remaining arrears in dividends on those shares.</p>
<p>This instalment was originally to be paid in March 1997 with the third and final instalment to be paid no later than March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The cash dividends per share will be paid on January 1, 1997 to holders of record on December 13, 1996.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
